# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Research vault
#
# The NOTES are tracked on purpose — they are our own writing, they are the
# project's reasoning, and factory workers spawn a worktree from HEAD and must
# be able to read them. See docs/specs/*-redteam-report.md finding C-1.
#
# The SOURCE DOCUMENTS are not. Rulebooks obtained for reference are
# copyrighted and must never be redistributed — not in this repo, not in a
# release, not anywhere. Keep them local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
vault/**/*.pdf
vault/**/*.epub
vault/**/*.mobi
vault/**/*.cbz
vault/**/*.cbr
vault/**/*.zip

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.log

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Research-session artifacts (agent scratch, not project files)
.playwright-mcp/
*.stackdump
bgg.xml

# forge-factory scratch (autonomous-build run state, logs, audit backups)
.forge-factory/
*.audit-backup-*

# code graph output (generated by logic-dev-kit)
graphify-out/

# Local Foundry access runbook (not for sharing)
docs/_local-foundry-access.md

# stray Playwright screenshots at repo root
*-live.png
*-post-fix.png
*-check.png
.playwright-mcp/

# Generated TypeDoc API reference (run: npm run docs)
docs/api/
docs/api-full-thrust/

# Local secrets + live-test artifacts (never commit)
.portainer-key
*.ptr_key
/local-test/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Agent worktrees + Claude local state
.claude/
